WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.837 --> 00:00:02.487
(accordion music)
(applause)

00:00:02.487 --> 00:00:03.320
[Conan O'Brien] This is Kreuzburg.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.667
It's a section of Berlin,

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:05.640
but like every place else

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.218
it's just exploding with life and energy.

00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:09.968
Here you've got dreadlocks.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.208
People wearing eye patches.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:12.298
People with parrots.

00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:13.499
Parrots with eye patches.

00:00:13.499 --> 00:00:14.907
Parrots with dreadlocks.

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:16.148
That's Berlin.

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:17.269
Good to see you.

00:00:17.269 --> 00:00:18.898
It takes him seven days

00:00:18.898 --> 00:00:20.522
to get through an airport metal detector.

00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:21.355
(audience laughs)

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:23.327
Guten Tag, Guten Tag!

00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:25.602
Everybody just sees me

00:00:25.602 --> 00:00:28.119
and they want a piece of me.

00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:30.952
(audience laughs)

00:00:33.059 --> 00:00:34.624
(audience laughs)

00:00:34.624 --> 00:00:35.457
[Fan] Hello, Conan O'Brien?

00:00:35.457 --> 00:00:36.554
[Conan] Yes, that right!
Hi!

00:00:36.554 --> 00:00:37.387
How are you?

00:00:37.387 --> 00:00:38.957
I came all the way up
from Bavaria to see you.

00:00:38.957 --> 00:00:39.790
You did?

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:40.623
And I have something for you!

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:41.456
(Conan yells)
(audience laughs)

00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:43.105
What was that, that was
scary the way you said it!

00:00:43.105 --> 00:00:44.563
Settle down!
I'm quite nervous anyways.

00:00:44.563 --> 00:00:45.729
Don't worry.

00:00:45.729 --> 00:00:46.861
Haha!

00:00:46.861 --> 00:00:48.109
I found an error!

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:51.221
If you think you spotted an
error on our show report it.

00:00:51.221 --> 00:00:53.133
Haha, I found an error!

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:55.152
That's from our show, you
really do see the show!

00:00:55.152 --> 00:00:55.985
That's so nice.

00:00:55.985 --> 00:00:57.911
Last show Friday you said

00:00:57.911 --> 00:01:01.032
that the chili stuff the chef ate

00:01:01.032 --> 00:01:05.141
was five thousand times
hotter than Tabasco sauce.

00:01:05.141 --> 00:01:08.171
The noodles were five
thousand times hotter

00:01:08.171 --> 00:01:09.819
than Tabasco sauce.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:12.701
But Tabasco sauce is 5,000 Scoville

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.592
and what he ate had 20,000,000.

00:01:14.592 --> 00:01:19.032
5,000 times 5,000 is two
million five hundred thousand.

00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:21.210
So you would have, should have said 4,000.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:22.432
And the article even said so.

00:01:22.432 --> 00:01:24.149
But since you don't have the time,

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:26.280
I found a lot more errors, errors.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:28.718
(audience laughs and cheers)
I made a list with another 50.

00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:31.547
Okay. These are all the errors
that you found on my show?

00:01:31.547 --> 00:01:32.380
I do watch your show,

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:34.952
but I watch it at 2.6 times the speed.

00:01:34.952 --> 00:01:36.075
I found a lot of mistakes.

00:01:36.075 --> 00:01:37.408
You found a lot of mistakes on our show?

00:01:37.408 --> 00:01:38.241
[Fan] Yeah.

00:01:38.241 --> 00:01:39.074
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.074 --> 00:01:39.907
[Conan] And you traveled two hours

00:01:39.907 --> 00:01:40.979
to give me these mistakes?

00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:42.337
[Fan] Yeah. Almost three hours, yeah.

00:01:42.337 --> 00:01:43.196
[Conan] Three hours from Bavaria?

00:01:43.196 --> 00:01:44.676
[Fan] Yes.

00:01:44.676 --> 00:01:45.906
[Conan] And uh...

00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:47.066
We Germans, we mean business.

00:01:47.066 --> 00:01:48.355
Yeah, you do mean business.

00:01:48.355 --> 00:01:49.188
Yes.

00:01:49.188 --> 00:01:50.576
You stay right there.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:51.807
Can you come here for a second?

00:01:51.807 --> 00:01:52.640
Yeah.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:54.907
I want to talk to you about your friend.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:55.740
(audience laughs)

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:56.911
I'm really worried about him.

00:01:56.911 --> 00:01:57.899
Yeah, handwritten so you know-

00:01:57.899 --> 00:01:58.780
(Conan exclaims over Fan)
(audience laughs)

00:01:58.780 --> 00:01:59.613
It's all good!

00:01:59.613 --> 00:02:00.446
No one gets hurt!

00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:01.279
All good!

00:02:01.279 --> 00:02:02.185
(audience laughs)

00:02:02.185 --> 00:02:03.340
Get him medicine, okay?

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:04.522
We'll rejoin him now.

00:02:04.522 --> 00:02:05.800
Well, this is fantastic.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.466
(Fan laughs loudly)
Thank you very much.

00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:09.282
Listen, it's called Ritalin.

00:02:09.282 --> 00:02:11.035
35 milligrams.
(audience laughs)

00:02:11.035 --> 00:02:13.201
Very high, it's what they
use on circus elephants.

00:02:13.201 --> 00:02:15.940
(Conan pats Fan's shoulder)
(audience laughs)

